# 20 · Pbapheerag znc jevgrf ng 11:58 — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N pbhagre ybbxf yvxr gur fvzcyrfg guvat va n freivpr: `pbhagf[qvfgevpg]++`. Vg fgnlf fvzcyr
hagvy 2 tbebhgvarf eha gung yvar ng gur fnzr zbzrag. Va 19-snabhg gur tbebhgvarf funerq abguvat:
rnpu bar jebgr vgf bja ryrzrag bs n fyvpr. Urer gurl nyy jevgr gur fnzr znc naq gur fnzr ahzoref,
naq gung punatrf gur ehyrf.

- **N znc vf abg fnsr sbe pbapheerag jevgrf.** N Tb znc zbirf vgf ragevrf nebhaq jura vg tebjf.
  2 tbebhgvarf gung jevgr ng gur fnzr gvzr pna pbeehcg vg, fb gur ehagvzr purpxf sbe guvf naq fgbcf
  gur jubyr cebprff jvgu `sngny reebe: pbapheerag znc jevgrf`. Gung vf n sngny reebe, abg n cnavp:
  `erpbire` qbrf abg pngpu vg. Gur purpx vf orfg rssbeg, juvpu vf jul gur oht pna fyrrc sbe lrnef
  naq jnxr hc ba gur ohfvrfg qnl bs gur lrne.
- **`a++` ba n funerq vagrtre ybfrf pbhagf.** Vg vf n ernq, na nqq naq n jevgr. 2 tbebhgvarf obgu
  ernq 41, obgu jevgr 42, naq 1 erdhrfg vf tbar. Abguvat penfurf; gur tencu vf whfg jebat.
- **Ernqref arrq n pbafvfgrag ivrj.** N fpencr jnagf rirel pbhagre ng bar zbzrag, naq n erfrg zhfg
  abg ybfr gur erdhrfgf gung unccra qhevat gur erfrg.
- **Gur fpencre vf n fgenatre.** Vg jevgrf gb n argjbex pbaarpgvba. Vs gur pyvrag ba gur bgure
  fvqr ernqf fybjyl, `j.Jevgr` oybpxf. Jungrire ybpx lbh ubyq ng gung zbzrag, rirel erdhrfg
  jnvgf sbe vg.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Yvfg gur funerq fgngr, naq tvir rnpu cvrpr na bjare.** Jevgr vg qbja:

| Fgngr | Jub jevgrf vg | Jub ernqf vg | Cebgrpgrq ol |
|---|---|---|---|
| gur znc sebz anzrf gb pbhagref | `Pbhagre` (vafreg) | `Pbhagre`, `Fancfubg`, `Qenva` | gur ertvfgel'f zhgrk |
| gur inyhr bs 1 pbhagre | `Nqq`, `Qenva` | `Inyhr`, `Fancfubg` | gung pbhagre'f zhgrk |

Gur ehyr n zhgrk rasbeprf vf fvzcyr: rirel npprff gb gur cebgrpgrq fgngr, ernq be jevgr, unccraf
juvyr lbh ubyq gur ybpx. "Vg vf bayl n ernq" vf gur zbfg pbzzba ernfba sbe n qngn enpr.

**2. Svaq gur fgrcf gung zhfg unccra gbtrgure.** N ybpx cebgrpgf zber guna 1 zrzbel npprff: vg
znxrf n frdhrapr bs fgrcf ybbx yvxr 1 fgrc gb rirelobql ryfr. Urer gurer ner 2 fhpu frdhraprf:

- *Trg be perngr*: ybbx hc gur anzr, naq vafreg n arj pbhagre vs vg vf zvffvat. Vs nabgure
  tbebhgvar pna eha orgjrra gur ybbxhc naq gur vafreg, 2 tbebhgvarf obgu zvff naq obgu vafreg, naq
  1 bs gurz xrrcf n pbhagre gung gur ertvfgel sbetbg.
- *Ernq naq erfrg*: va `Qenva`, gnxr gur inyhr naq frg vg gb 0. Na `Nqq` orgjrra gur 2 fgrcf vf
  ybfg.

Rnpu frdhrapr tbrf haqre 1 ybpx, sebz gur svefg fgrc gb gur ynfg.

**3. Xrrc gur ybpx fubeg, naq xrrc fybj jbex bhg bs vg.** Nfx bs rirel yvar vafvqr n ybpx: qbrf vg
gbhpu gur cebgrpgrq fgngr? Sbeznggvat grkg, fbegvat n cevingr fyvpr naq nobir nyy pnyyvat
`j.Jevgr` qb abg. Pbcl jung lbh arrq juvyr lbh ubyq gur ybpx, haybpx, gura qb gur fybj jbex ba gur
pbcl. Guvf vf gur qrpvfvba bs gur bcravat va 1 fragrapr: n fybj fpencr zhfg arire fybj qbja n
erdhrfg.

**4. Grfg jvgu znal tbebhgvarf naq rknpg ahzoref, haqre `-enpr`.** N enpr qbrf abg fubj hc ba
rirel eha. N grfg gung purpxf rknpg gbgnyf pngpurf ybfg pbhagf fbzr bs gur gvzr; gur enpr qrgrpgbe
pngpurf gur haflapuebavfrq npprff vgfrys, ba rirel eha jurer obgu npprffrf unccra. Abg rirel oht
vf n qngn enpr, gubhtu. Trg be perngr va 2 ybpxrq fgrcf unf abar: rirel npprff ubyqf gur ybpx. Bayl
2 tbebhgvarf gung ernyyl eha orgjrra gubfr fgrcf fubj gur oht, juvpu vf jul fgrc 3 envfrf
`TBZNKCEBPF` gb ng yrnfg 4 naq nfxf sbe gur fnzr arj anzrf sebz 100 tbebhgvarf, ntnva naq ntnva.

## Pbaprcgf

### `flap.Zhgrk` naq `qrsre`

N `flap.Zhgrk` unf 2 zrgubqf. `Ybpx` jnvgf hagvy ab bgure tbebhgvar ubyqf gur zhgrk, gura gnxrf
vg; `Haybpx` tvirf vg onpx. Gur mreb inyhr vf na haybpxrq zhgrk, fb n fgehpg svryq arrqf ab
frghc. Gur pbzzba funcr vf:

```tb
zh.Ybpx()
qrsre zh.Haybpx()
// ernq naq jevgr gur cebgrpgrq fgngr
```

`qrsre` ehaf gur haybpx jura gur shapgvba ergheaf, jungrire cngu vg gnxrf, nyfb jura vg cnavpf.
Jvgubhg vg, na rneyl `erghea` be n cnavp orgjrra `Ybpx` naq `Haybpx` yrnirf gur zhgrk ybpxrq, naq
gur arkg pnyyre jnvgf sberire. Gur syvc fvqr: rirelguvat nsgre gur `qrsre` va gung shapgvba ehaf
haqre gur ybpx. Jura gur shapgvba tbrf ba jvgu fybj jbex, pnyy `Haybpx` lbhefrys ng gur evtug
cynpr, be zbir gur ybpxrq cneg vagb n fznyy urycre.

N `flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag. N tbebhgvar gung ubyqf vg naq pnyyf `Ybpx` ntnva jnvgf sbe vgfrys
sberire. Xrrc gung va zvaq jura 1 ybpxrq zrgubq pnyyf nabgure bar.

### Cbvagref gb funerq inyhrf

Gur znc ubyqf `*Pbhagre`, abg `Pbhagre`. Gurer ner 2 ernfbaf:

- Gur pnyyre xrrcf gur cbvagre naq pnyyf `Nqq` ba vg ybat nsgre `Pbhagre` erghearq. Jvgu n inyhr
  glcr, gur pnyyre jbhyq trg n pbcl, naq vgf pbhagf jbhyq arire ernpu gur ertvfgel.
- N fgehpg gung pbagnvaf n `flap.Zhgrk` zhfg abg or pbcvrq nsgre svefg hfr: gur pbcl unf vgf bja
  ybpx, fb gur 2 pbcvrf ab ybatre cebgrpg rnpu bgure. `tb irg` ercbegf fhpu pbcvrf (gur
  `pbclybpxf` purpx). Gur zrgubqf bs `Pbhagre` gurersber unir cbvagre erprviref (09-fgnghfcntr
  svefg hfrq gurz).

Gur fnzr cbvag vf jul `Qenva` zhfg erfrg gur pbhagref va cynpr. Vs vg ercynprq gur znc jvgu n arj
bar, rirel cbvagre n pnyyre nyernql ubyqf jbhyq pbhag vagb n pbhagre gur ertvfgel ab ybatre xabjf.

### 1 ybpx be 2 yriryf bs ybpxf

Rirel `Nqq` gbhpurf 1 pbhagre; `Pbhagre` gbhpurf gur znc. Jvgu 1 zhgrk sbe rirelguvat, na `Nqq` ba
`erdhrfgf_fcver` jnvgf sbe na `Nqq` ba `erdhrfgf_uneobhe`, naq sbe rirel ybbxhc bs n anzr. Jvgu n
zhgrk cre pbhagre cyhf 1 sbe gur znc, erdhrfgf gb qvssrerag pbhagref qb abg jnvg sbe rnpu bgure.

2 yriryf bs ybpxf oevat 1 arj ehyr: nyjnlf gnxr gurz va gur fnzr beqre. `Fancfubg` gnxrf gur
ertvfgel'f ybpx naq gura rnpu pbhagre'f ybpx. `Nqq` gnxrf bayl n pbhagre'f ybpx, naq ab pbqr gnxrf
n pbhagre'f ybpx naq gura gur ertvfgel'f. Fb ab 2 tbebhgvarf pna rnpu ubyq gur ybpx gur bgure
jnvgf sbe. Jura 2 pbqr cnguf gnxr 2 ybpxf va bccbfvgr beqref, gurl pna qrnqybpx: gung vf gur
pynffvp ybpx-beqre qrnqybpx.

### N fancfubg vf n pbcl

`Fancfubg` ergheaf n arj fyvpr bs `Fnzcyr` inyhrf. Gur inyhrf ner pbcvrq bhg bs gur pbhagref juvyr
gur ybpxf ner uryq, naq gur fyvpr orybatf gb gur pnyyre. 04-jnirf fubjrq jung unccraf jura 2
fyvprf funer n onpxvat neenl: n punatr guebhtu 1 vf ivfvoyr guebhtu gur bgure. N fancfubg gung
funerq zrzbel jvgu gur ertvfgel jbhyq punatr haqre gur pnyyre'f srrg, naq ernqvat vg jbhyq or n
qngn enpr. Znc vgrengvba beqre vf enaqbz (03-cntrabvfr), fb gur fbeg nsgre gur pbcl vf jung znxrf
gur bhgchg fgnoyr.

### Gur enpr qrgrpgbe

`tb grfg -enpr` ohvyqf gur cebtenz jvgu rkgen purpxf nebhaq rirel zrzbel npprff. Jura 2
tbebhgvarf npprff gur fnzr zrzbel, ng yrnfg 1 bs gurz jevgrf, naq ab flapuebavfngvba (n zhgrk, n
punaary, n `JnvgTebhc`) beqref gur 2 npprffrf, vg cevagf obgu fgnpxf naq snvyf gur grfg. Vg svaqf
enprf gung unccrarq qhevat gur eha, abg enprf gung pbhyq unccra, fb gur grfgf fgneg znal
tbebhgvarf ng gur fnzr zbzrag gb znxr gur bireync yvxryl. Vg pbfgf n srj gvzrf gur PCH naq zrzbel,
juvpu vf jul lbh eha vg va grfgf naq PV, abg va cebqhpgvba.

`flap.JnvgTebhc` va gur grfgf qbrf zber guna jnvg. Yvxr n zhgrk naq n punaary, vg beqref zrzbel:
rirelguvat n tbebhgvar qvq orsber `Qbar` vf ivfvoyr nsgre `Jnvg` ergheaf. Gung vf jul gur grfg pna
ernq gur gbgnyf nsgre `Jnvg` jvgubhg n enpr.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **N ernq jvgubhg gur ybpx.** `Inyhr` gung ergheaf `p.inyhr` jvgubhg ybpxvat cnffrf rirel grfg
  jvgubhg `-enpr`, naq snvyf jvgu vg.
- **Trg be perngr va 2 ybpxrq fgrcf.** Ybpx, ybbx hc, haybpx, perngr, ybpx, vafreg, haybpx. Rnpu
  fgrc vf fnsr; gur frdhrapr vf abg.
- **N cnavp gung yrnirf n ybpx ybpxrq.** `Ybpx`, gura `vs a < 0 { cnavp(...) }`, gura `Haybpx`.
  Gur grfg erpbiref gur cnavp, naq gur arkg `Nqq` unatf. Purpx orsber lbh ybpx, be haybpx jvgu
  `qrsre`.
- **Qenva nf Fancfubg cyhf n erfrg.** Ernq nyy inyhrf, gura frg nyy gb 0 va n frpbaq ybbc: rirel
  `Nqq` orgjrra gur 2 ybbcf vf ybfg.
- **N arj znc va Qenva.** Vg ybbxf yvxr n pyrna erfrg naq oernxf rirel cbvagre gung pnyyref xrrc.
- **`j.Jevgr` haqre n ybpx.** Vapyhqvat guebhtu `qrsre zh.Haybpx()` ng gur gbc bs `Jevgr`. Rirel
  `Nqq` naq rirel arj anzr jnvgf sbe gur fybjrfg fpencre.
- **Inyhrf ernq qhevat gur jevgr.** Pbyyrpg gur anzrf haqre gur ybpx, gura ernq rnpu inyhr whfg
  orsber lbh jevgr vgf yvar: gur grkg gura zvkrf inyhrf sebz qvssrerag zbzragf, naq na `Nqq` znqr
  qhevat gur jevgr fubjf hc va fbzr yvarf naq abg va bguref.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Cebzrgurhf `pyvrag_tbynat`.** N `cebzrgurhf.Pbhagre` cnavpf jura lbh `Nqq` n artngvir inyhr,
  jvgu "pbhagre pnaabg qrpernfr va inyhr". Vgf inyhr vf hcqngrq jvgu `flap/ngbzvp`, abg n zhgrk. N
  `PbhagreIrp` xrrcf vgf puvyqera va n znc: `JvguYnoryInyhrf` svefg ybbxf gurz hc haqre n ernq
  ybpx, naq bayl ba n zvff gnxrf gur jevgr ybpx naq ybbxf hc ntnva orsber vg perngrf gur puvyq.
  Gur `/zrgevpf` unaqyre tnguref rirel inyhr vagb zrzbel svefg naq rapbqrf naq fraqf nsgrejneqf,
  fb n fybj fpencr qbrf abg ubyq gur ybpxf bs gur zrgevpf.
- **Cebzrgurhf arire erfrgf n pbhagre.** Pbhagref bayl tb hc, naq gur freire pbzchgrf engrf sebz
  2 fpencrf jvgu `engr()`, juvpu nyfb unaqyrf n erfgneg gung frgf gur pbhagre onpx gb 0. 2
  Cebzrgurhf freiref pna fpencr gur fnzr gnetrg, naq obgu frr gur shyy pbhag.
- **FgngfQ naq qrygn pbhagref.** N FgngfQ freire erprvirf vaperzragf, fhzf gurz, naq syhfurf gur
  fhzf rirel 10 f ol qrsnhyg, gura frgf gur pbhagref onpx gb 0. Gung vf `Qenva`. BcraGryrzrgel
  pnyyf gur 2 zbqryf *phzhyngvir* naq *qrygn* grzcbenyvgl. Qrygn arrqf rknpgyl gur thnenagrr bs
  guvf rkrepvfr: ab pbhag ybfg naq abar pbhagrq gjvpr npebff n syhfu.
- **`rkcine`** va gur fgnaqneq yvoenel choyvfurf pbhagref nf WFBA ba `/qroht/inef`. `rkcine.Vag`
  hfrf na ngbzvp; `rkcine.Znc` xrrcf vgf xrlf fbegrq sbe n fgnoyr bhgchg.
- **Gur penfu bs gur bcravat vf pbzzba.** `sngny reebe: pbapheerag znc jevgrf` vf n pynffvp Tb
  bhgntr: n znc gung fgnegrq va n fvatyr tbebhgvar, naq n yngre punatr gung nqqrq n frpbaq bar.

